<div class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Help Centre</span>
    <h1>Returns & Refunds</h1>
    <p>Your satisfaction is our priority. If you're not happy, we'll make it right.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="page-content">

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-bottom:56px;">
      <div style="background:var(--cream);padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">📦</div>
        <strong style="display:block;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:6px;">30-Day Returns</strong>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0;">Return within 30 days of delivery</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--cream);padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">💳</div>
        <strong style="display:block;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:6px;">Fast Refunds</strong>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0;">Processed in 5–7 business days</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--cream);padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">📧</div>
        <strong style="display:block;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:6px;">Easy Process</strong>
        <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0;">Just email us to get started</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Return Eligibility</h2>
    <p>To be eligible for a return, items must be:</p>
    <ul style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:2.2;padding-left:20px;list-style:disc;margin-bottom:32px;font-size:0.9375rem;">
      <li>Returned within <strong style="color:var(--black);">30 days</strong> of the delivery date</li>
      <li>Unused and in the original condition</li>
      <li>In original packaging with proof of purchase</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Non-Returnable Items</h2>
    <ul style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:2.2;padding-left:20px;list-style:disc;margin-bottom:32px;font-size:0.9375rem;">
      <li>Opened or used skincare products (for hygiene reasons)</li>
      <li>Gift cards and final sale items</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to Start a Return</h2>
    <ol style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:2.4;padding-left:20px;list-style:decimal;margin-bottom:40px;font-size:0.9375rem;">
      <li>Email <a href="mailto:support@{{ shop.domain }}" style="color:var(--gold);">support@{{ shop.domain }}</a> with your order number</li>
      <li>We'll send return confirmation and address within 24 hours</li>
      <li>Ship your item back securely</li>
      <li>Refund processed within 5–7 business days of receipt</li>
    </ol>

    <div style="background:var(--black);padding:36px;text-align:center;color:white;">
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-heading);color:white;margin-bottom:10px;">Need Help?</h3>
      <p style="opacity:0.7;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:0.9375rem;">We respond within 24 hours, Monday–Friday.</p>
      <a href="mailto:support@{{ shop.domain }}" style="background:white;color:var(--black);padding:12px 32px;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;">Email Us</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Page - Returns", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
